Correction (hytale-reviewer, same day): the line "all read from the implementation rather than from the codec's own key descriptions" is false for Count. TriggerSpawnMarkersInteraction's codec documents that key as "Max number of spawn markers to activate. Set to 0 to activate all spawn markers." — implementation and codec doc agree. The gotcha still earns its place, because a JSON author never sees that string, but it is not a codec-doc-vs-reality find like SpawnYawOffset and should not be cited as one. The page's own wording ("the validator accepts it without comment") was already correct and is unchanged.
